    {
      "_id": "d9b0e4ed60b4491b",
      "name": "Thaumaturgy (Spirit Manipulation) — 2 Intermediate — Voice of Command",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Spending a Willpower Trait and winning a Mental Challenge against a spirit compels it to obey a command, so long as the command doesn't endanger it or violate its ethics. Spending a second Willpower Trait and winning another Mental Challenge can force it into a self-endangering or unethical act, though the spirit will likely seek revenge later, or may simply pretend to comply. Losing a challenge against a spirit while using this power risks provoking a retaliatory attack.</p>",
        "source": "Camarilla Guide, Disciplines",
        "discipline": "Thaumaturgy (Spirit Manipulation)",
